# Health and Workout Data Extracted from Apple Health via Health Auto Export

This section logs detailed daily health and workout metrics extracted from the JSON exports generated by Health Auto Export on iPhone.

Each day gets a heading with the date (YYYY-MM-DD) followed by two sections: Health Metrics and Workouts.

Health Metrics include: Steps, Resting HR, Weight, HRV, Sleep (total and deep), VO2Max, Active Energy, Basal Energy, Exercise Minutes.

Workouts are listed per entry with: activity type, duration, distance, active energy, basal energy.

The format is designed to be both human-readable and machine-parseable for training advice generation.
